I want to hold the mouse button to fire in a game and at the same time scroll down the mouse to overcome the gun recoil.
Doing "hold_keys(BTN_LEFT).mouse(down, 60)" causes the fire button to be held and the scroll to happen after releasing 
the input button. How do I have it repeat both clicking the left mouse and scrolling down at the same time?

Sezanzeb:
The following will work:

key_down(BTN_LEFT)
.mouse(down, 60)
.key_up(BTN_LEFT)

which holds down BTN_LEFT while it moves the mouse down.

=====

You can also do:

hold(
  key(BTN_LEFT)
  .event(EV_REL, REL_Y, 60)
  .wait(100)
)

Which presses BTN_LEFT and moves down your mouse repeatedly every 100ms.
